5Ki\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kuOZwG9s\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-MdmmeELg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lgYQBcmb\">package_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-KdpnL9yH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fnc56qcJ\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-fTCn5oOD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5yb9Nqn3\">应用包ID，获取方法见接口文档<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710742760448\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【查询应用信息】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-vsIKYEx9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-kOZbhHiR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KuZB6nk0\">mode<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Ni2ndLf0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0Yr7nLsH\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-elfcRNCU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8Rso4qW7\">更新分包模式，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">All</code>全部更新（将所有子包更新至最新母包版本）<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">List</code>部分更新（将指定子包更新至最新母包版本）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-JYFNkKnp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-SarKZyKK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AJg33eT6\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"></span>channel_list</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ZsbWloit\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VTDFbxjF\">object[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-NpoVD3o2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-g6q5x1EB\">渠道号信息，（mode=<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">List</code>时需指定），一次调用，list的size取值范围<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">1~100</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ziuBkddE